        <cve>CVE-2002-1623</cve>
        <exploit_available>false</exploit_available>
        <synopsis>The VPN gateway answers IKE Aggressive Mode with a pre-shared key: anyone who knows a group name gets a hash of its group password to crack offline.</synopsis>
